  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">是以云计算、大数据、</span>5G技术等现代信息技术为基础，以移动终端应用为核心，以感知互动等高效信息服务为特征，为游客提供高效便捷的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">信息服务的产品。基于</span>3DGIS+BIM，通过BIM数字</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">平台对业务进行集中管理和控制，</span>BIM模型打造数字孪生世界，实现一图统管，一屏观全局。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">平台介绍</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">(1)</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">管理</span>:有效提高政府综合监管水平，提高政府服务创新能力，建立健全产业管理和服务综合体系，规范产业发展，促进产业升级。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">(2)</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">服务</span>:以游客为中心，以吃、住、行、游、购、娱为重点，有序整合</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">六要素，为游客提供便捷的一站式服务。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">营销：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">整合</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">相关企业的服务资源，促进企业经营和区域经济更好地发展</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">结合起来，提高服务质量和企业竞争力，帮助企业转型升级服务。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">数字孪生，全球视角推动智慧文化</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">“景区”到“全球”，建立虚拟现实景区世界，将数字空间和物理空间与社会空间联系起来，建立应用，打造“</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">文化</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">数字孪生综合服务管理平台</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">”。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">景区综合形势</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">基于</span>GIS地理信息和数字双胞胎技术，结合综合时空多维数据，构建三维数字双胞胎控制系统。支持景区网格化管理。通过对自然环境、客流、停车、基础设施运维等关键指标的综合检测和分析，实现人、事、物的统一监管。根据景区公共服务设施分布、主要景区分布、景区基本图形信息等数据，绘制“景区双胞胎控制图”，实现景区资源基本概况。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">景区客流检测</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">利用数字孪生大数据集成发动机，高度集成了景区售票系统、检票系统、景区实时监控系统等业务系统。实时监控游客数量、游客数量、游客位置、游客运行轨迹、密度等信息。同时，基于历史客流数据，结合专业预测模型，设置客流阈值，实现超限自动报警，为景区管理者提供有力支持，如流量控制、人流引导、安全保障等。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">应急指挥计划</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">基于专业可靠的业务分析模型，支持模拟景区应急基础设备状态、使用数量、行动路线、环境状态等。，从而提高重点区域的指挥效率，增强管理者处理突发事件的能力和水平。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">景区大数据分析应用平台：结合</span>GIS、三维模型、数字孪生数据集成引擎等。，真实、立体、时序化地反映和表达空间。利用数据挖掘和分析工具进行标准化的数据分析、总结和计算，帮助景区建立地理信息数据库和游客服务信息数据库，构建以景区自然环境、文物、建筑和稀有资源为主要对象的景区资源数据库。同时打开数据接口，实现与省级平台的数据对接，实现数据的存储、管理、应用和共享。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">预约分析</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">将改变传统的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">管理模式。通过信息技术，我们可以及时准确地掌握预约管理、活动信息和景区管理以及商品管理的基本信息。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">数字化运营系统</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">(1)VR全景</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">地图</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">数字孪生，</span>GIS、可视化渲染、VR全景等技术制作1：三维实景，将景区浓缩成立体画卷。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">景点的分布以音、视、图、文的形式呈现。通过</span>VR全景展示，景区全貌得到充分展示，为游客带来360度身临其境的体验。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">(2)导游“5G+数字人”</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">基于</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">讲解系统，为景区定制数字导游，将</span>AI数字导游嵌入VR全景显示屏，通过多媒体为游客提供综合讲解服务。打造一个文化</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">文旅</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">IP形象的数字导游。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">数字导游为游客提供</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">导游服务，整合周边资源，为服务区的游客提供便捷的服务，如吃喝玩乐、衣食住行等。解决公共场所人工服务的不足，提高运营效率。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:arial;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">(3)</span>VR全景交易平台</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">地图包括景区周边全景</span>B&amp;B酒店和餐厅的在线观看功能，通过现场VR全景拍摄，真实展示住宿和餐厅环境。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">平台可以打开携程等各大在线订单预约平台，客户可以直接点击</span>VR中的订单按钮进行支付。按照“限量、预约、错峰”的规则，实现分时预约，科学引导分流，减轻景区资源的瞬时承载压力。</span></p><p><br /></p>",
